  "described": {
    "alt_text": "A dense oil painting of globe headed figures with hash mark faces walking through a city of towers, under giant round faces and dollar signs.",
    "description": "A square oil painting on canvas. Two huge round faces with hash mark eyes and dark mouths fill the upper left and centre top, one red and one blue, like planets. A white globe face with a toothed grin sits at upper right. Below them, towers of brown, orange and blue with window slots carry scrawled dollar signs and hash symbols, and tiny pod bodied figures with helmet heads walk along bridges and railings. The lower half is a street crowd of larger figures with striped globe heads, each face a few hash strokes, holding small screens on sticks. Spheres and striped balls hang in the air. Thick black outlines, strong local colour, visible brushwork.",
    "impression": "A video game level where the sky itself is watching. The dollar signs and the handheld screens make it feel like a market or an arcade, and the giant faces overhead are the bosses. Everyone is on their way somewhere with a device in hand, which in 2008 was a sharper joke than it is now.",
